      "cooked": "<p>I was thinking of buying these to use for my decks since I can get them for cheap and because I am poor. I have not been playing the actual cards as much lately due to schudules but do want something to protect them when I do. My solo games have been slowly switching to digital so I dont have to spend 30 minutes setting up by myself anymore.</p><p><br>Anyone that uses these have thoughts. Probably cant afford nice sleeves right now due to them being 3 bucks a pack and needing 50 packs to fully sleeve sentinels right now.</p>",
