      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/{size}/1961_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-11T20:31:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've sleeved my Sentinels in Ultra Pro Penny sleeves, and have had no real issues.</p><p>They are just the tiniest bit too slightly too tall for the box, but they still fit just fine. &nbsp;Actually, because of this they sit&nbsp;<em>really</em> tightly in the box, which makes them slightly harder to remove, but it's no biggy.</p>",
